// =============================================================================
// PAGE 60: INCIDENT RESPONSE PROTOCOL
// =============================================================================

#import "../styles.typ": *

#let page-incident-protocol(data) = {
  pagebreak()
  
  [Dear Contractor,]
  
  v(1em)
  
  text(size: 10pt)[
    We hope this message finds you well. We appreciate your dedication and commitment to our company and the services we provide. In light of recent events, we would like to remind you of an important protocol regarding the handling of information in case of any incidents.
  ]
  
  v(1em)
  
  text(size: 10pt)[
    It is crucial that our team follows a specific procedure to ensure that all necessary steps are taken in a timely and accurate manner. Therefore, we kindly request that you refrain from providing any information, whether verbally or in writing, to any external parties in the event of an incident.
  ]
  
  v(1em)
  
  text(size: 10pt)[
    Instead, we ask that you follow these steps:
  ]
  
  v(0.5em)
  
  text(size: 10pt)[
    1. Ensure Safety First: Prioritize the safety and well-being of all individuals involved in the incident. If immediate medical attention is required, please call for assistance immediately.
  ]
  
  v(0.5em)
  
  text(size: 10pt)[
    2. Contact Us Promptly: After ensuring the immediate safety of all parties, please contact our designated incident response team as soon as possible. They will provide you with further instructions and guidance on how to proceed.
  ]
  
  v(0.5em)
  
  text(size: 10pt)[
    3. Wait for Instructions: Please refrain from discussing any details or providing statements to external parties, including law enforcement, insurance representatives, or any other individuals, until you have received explicit instructions from our incident response team.
  ]
  
  v(0.5em)
  
  text(size: 10pt)[
    4. Document Incident Details: While waiting for our guidance, it is important to take note of relevant details such as date, time, location, and any other pertinent information. This information will be valuable in the subsequent investigation process.
  ]
  
  v(0.5em)
  
  text(size: 10pt)[
    5. Cooperate with Internal Investigation: Once our incident response team is engaged, we will guide you through the process of providing the necessary information to help us handle the situation effectively.
  ]
  
  v(1em)
  
  text(size: 10pt)[
    We understand the importance of clear communication, and we assure you that our incident response team is well-equipped to handle any situation that may arise. Your cooperation in following this protocol is vital to ensuring a smooth and efficient resolution.
  ]
  
  v(1em)
  
  text(size: 10pt)[
    If you have any questions or concerns regarding this protocol, please do not hesitate to reach out to contact\@mfleet.org.
  ]
  
  v(1em)
  
  [Thank you for your cooperation and continued dedication to our company.]
}
